[I] Provides functionality to encode and decode LTC audio

[T] libltc provides functionality to encode and decode Linear (Longitudinal)
[T] Timecode (LTC) audio signals from and to SMPTE or EBU timecode,
[T] including SMPTE date support. It is the successor of libltcsmpte.

[U] https://github.com/x42/libltc

[A] Libltc Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

